{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-pion-half-figure-eight","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:pion-half-figure-eight","kind":"proposition","title":"The pion braid and $\\sigma_1\\sigma_2^{-1}$ have identical eigenvalue phases on $V_{(2,1)}$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-figure-eight-reeb-rotation"],"cites":["references/wenzl1988c","references/jones1987"],"tags":["pion","figure-eight","half-rotation","reeb-flow","eigenvalue-phase","lepton-meson-bridge"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.pion_eq_half_figure_eight_phase","text":"pion-half-figure-eight.md","leanSource":"pion-half-figure-eight.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:pion-half-figure-eight\"></a><p>The pion braid <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{M}_+ = (\\sigma_1\\sigma_2)^2\\sigma_2\\sigma_1</code> and the half-figure-eight braid <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1\\sigma_2^{-1}</code> have identical eigenvalue phases when acting on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_{(2,1)}</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathrm{arg}\\bigl(\\lambda(\\mathfrak{M}_+)\\bigr)\n  = \\mathrm{arg}\\bigl(\\lambda(\\sigma_1\\sigma_2^{-1})\\bigr).</code></pre>\n<p>The figure-eight knot operator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\sigma_1\\sigma_2^{-1})^2</code> is exactly the square of the pion-type rotation.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/pion-half-figure-eight.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"7.10.23","page":"b/prop-pion-half-figure-eight","qa":{"counts":{"pass":91,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":9,"unknown":0,"stale":74},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.pion_eq_half_figure_eight_phase","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/pion-half-figure-eight.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
